{"meta":{"id":"front-pieces","category":"aide/modules","title":"프론트 재사용 UI 조각","subtitle":"(목업·레이아웃·메뉴)","summary":"목업 틀, 레이아웃(Header/Footer), 뎁스 메뉴","tags":["aide","모듈","프론트","react"],"color":"teal","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-linux-install","updatedAt":"2026-09-05"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-teal-100/70 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-60 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n<div class=\"absolute -bottom-16 -left-16 w-48 h-48 bg-teal-50/80 rounded-full blur-2xl opacity-80 pointer-events-none\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-teal-100/80\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\n    <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-teal-50 text-teal-700 border border-teal-200/60 tracking-wider\">\n      <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></span>\n      3-modules\n    </span>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wide uppercase text-stone-400 font-serif\">aide Reusable Modules</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">\n    프론트 재사용 UI 조각 <span class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-normal text-teal-600 font-serif\">(목업·레이아웃·메뉴)</span>\n  </h1>\n\n  <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-teal-50/60 border border-teal-100/70 rounded-xl p-3\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\">\n      <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\">\n      <strong class=\"text-stone-900\">문서 범위:</strong> 목적별로 분류해 그대로 갖다 쓰는 프론트 UI 조각(레이아웃/메뉴/목업)\n    </p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5 border-b border-stone-100\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div>\n    <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">핵심 포인트</h2>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">각 조각은 <strong class=\"font-bold text-stone-900\">독립적으로 떼어 써도 되게</strong> 설계됨 — 예: 메뉴는 레이아웃 없이 3개 파일만 갖다 써도 동작</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">목업 틀은 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">테스트(목업)</code> 규모 규칙과 정확히 맞물림 — 프레임워크 없는 순수 HTML/CSS/JS</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"py-5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div>\n      <h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide uppercase\">조각 구성</h2>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400 font-medium\">3종</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xs bg-white\">\n    <table class=\"table-fixed-layout text-left text-xs sm:text-sm\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr class=\"bg-stone-50/90 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider\">\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[26%]\">구분</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-1 w-[30%]\">파일</th>\n          <th class=\"py-2.5 px-3 sm:px-4 w-[44%]\">설명</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100 font-normal text-stone-700\">\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-stone-700 bg-stone-200/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded\">[0-mockup]</span>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">index/css/js</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">버튼 바 + 설정값 영역 + 결과 영역 기본 틀 (프레임워크 없음)</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-sky-700 bg-sky-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded\">[1-layaout]</span>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">Layout/Header/Footer.jsx</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">규모 무관 기본 레이아웃 뼈대, 메뉴는 2-menu에서 import</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40 transition-colors\">\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4\">\n            <span class=\"inline-block text-[11px] font-semibold text-emerald-700 bg-emerald-100/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded\">[2-menu]</span>\n          </td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-1 text-stone-900 font-mono text-[11px]\">Sidebar/menuData.js/css</td>\n          <td class=\"py-3 px-3 sm:px-4 text-stone-600 text-xs sm:text-[13px]\">3뎁스(대분류&gt;중분류&gt;링크) 재귀 렌더링 메뉴, 배열만 수정해서 관리</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-2 bg-stone-50 border border-stone-200/80 rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-4.5\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-2.5\">\n    <svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\">\n      <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path>\n    </svg>\n    <h3 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-stone-900\">알아두면 좋은 점</h3>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"space-y-2 text-stone-600 pl-1\">\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">뎁스를 늘리려면 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">menuData.css</code>의 depth0/1/2 스타일 기준으로 확장한다.</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"tip-bullet-row\">\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-500\">•</span>\n      <span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">헤더/사이드바/푸터 박스 스타일은 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">layout.css</code>, 메뉴 항목 스타일은 <code class=\"text-[12px] bg-stone-200/60 px-1 rounded\">menuData.css</code>로 파일이 나뉘어 있다.</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mt-5 pt-3 border-t border-stone-100 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] text-stone-400\">\n  <span>aide Reusable Modules</span>\n  <span>프론트 재사용 UI 조각</span>\n</div>\n","path":"aide/modules/front-pieces","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"aide","title":"aide","path":"aide"},{"id":"modules","title":"3-modules (재사용 모듈)","path":"aide/modules"}],"hasImage":false}